Lands Codex's uncommitted rebrand/migration work (~80 files), completed and
fixed where verified defective.

Codex's work, landed as-is after audit:
- Runtime home: packaged builds use ~/.nemesis / %LOCALAPPDATA%\nemesis and
  deliberately ignore global HERMES_HOME/registry state so installing Nemesis
  never adopts or mutates an independent agent install. School-browser CDP
  port 9333→9444 for the same reason.
- Updater/installer: every self-update and fallback-download URL repointed
  NousResearch/hermes-agent → AxelGalvez11/nemesis-desktop across Rust, TS,
  and Python; image-name taskkill replaced by path-scoped process kill;
  Tauri installer rebranded Nemesis-Setup; devtools disabled in packaged
  session windows; packaged school-view forced into CDP-free mirror mode.
- i18n string rebrand across en/ja/zh/zh-hant incl. two key renames; README
  rewrites; .gitignore secret/cert hardening.

NEW in this commit (completing the WIP):
- Consent-based data move: on first launch, when a legacy agent home exists
  and ~/.nemesis does not, a dialog offers 'Move it here' (rename) or 'Start
  fresh'. Nothing moves silently — an independent Hermes install is
  indistinguishable on disk from our own earlier beta, so only the user can
  tell them apart. detectLegacyHomeMigration() in nemesis-identity.ts with
  node tests (marker-gated, never fires once ~/.nemesis exists). Study
  material is unaffected either way (Documents, not the runtime home).
- Fixed verified WIP defects: boot.ts/updates.ts still called renamed i18n
  keys (raw key text would show on every boot and on the update toast);
  bootstrap-installer versions beta.1→beta.2 incl. install_script.rs UA;
  root package-lock regenerated (apps/desktop pinned at stale beta.1 broke
  npm ci); stale update.rs doc comment.
- Known gap left as-is: standalone install.sh/install.ps1 honor HERMES_HOME
  only (not NEMESIS_HOME); harmless in the orchestrated flow, which always
  passes HERMES_HOME explicitly.

Verified: renderer suite 163 files / 1346 tests green; electron platform
suite 313 pass / 0 fail (incl. 2 new migration tests); cargo check clean on
nemesis-bootstrap; npm run build clean. Original WIP authored by Codex.
